third_party/

# Vendor reference documents fetched for research (docs/refs/).
# Several Decawave/Qorvo PDFs carry "confidential / no reproduction permitted"
# footers, so they must NOT be committed. Source URLs are recorded in the
# research notes instead.
docs/refs/

# Vendor datasheets dropped into assets/ for research. assets/ itself is
# tracked (M5Stack's own schematics and images live there), but Qorvo /
# Decawave documents follow the same rule as docs/refs/ above: do not commit
# them. Source URLs are recorded in the research notes instead.
# assets/ 配下でも、Qorvo/Decawave のベンダ文書は docs/refs/ と同じ扱いで
# コミットしない（M5Stack 自身の回路図・画像は従来どおり追跡する）。
assets/QM33120W*.pdf
